              <description>If a non-vehicle model is slain as a result of this weapon, centre the large blast marker over that model before removing the model as a casualty.  Units suffer a number of Stength 5 AP4 hits equal to the number of models from that unit that are under the marker. These hits have the Ignores Cover special rule.</description>
