          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A shadow field confers a 2+ invulnerable save.  The shadow field save is lost for the rest of the battle at the end of any phase in which the model suffers one or more unsaved Wounds.</characteristic>
