    <selectionEntry name="(E) Swooping Hawks" id="2ae8-ccdf-5fe4-4437" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" publicationId="d744-5cc5-pubN69600" type="unit">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Strength from Death" id="0f84-89f3-45f7-df92" hidden="false" targetId="2052-4e5b-be4f-cab9" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink name="Fleet" id="761e-4330-5714-40df" hidden="false" targetId="39c6-1f20-a156-47f4" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Intercept" id="aeee-d1c2-808e-aebc" hidden="false" publicationId="d744-5cc5-pubN69600">
          <description>At the end of the Movement phase, a model with this special rule can make one Attack against an enemy Flyer or Flying Monstrous Creature that it moved over that turn.  The Attack hits on a roll of 4+ and is resolved at Strength 4 AP4 with the Haywire special rule.  Flyers are hit on their side armour.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Swooping Hawk Exarch" id="22de-78c2-3da2-8d9d" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" publicationId="d744-5cc5-pubN69600" type="model">
