        <rule name="Guided Wraithsight" id="9cb8-5ba9-6bfc-715e" hidden="false" publicationId="d744-5cc5-pubN69600">
          <description>Wraithguard, Wraithblades, Wraithlords, and Wraithknights from this Formation can re-roll failed To Hit rolls against enemy units that are within 18&quot; of the Spiritseer from this Formation.</description>
