      <rules>
        <rule name="Bring Forth the Torch" id="47c4-ad9e-992e-52b0" hidden="false" publicationId="d744-5cc5-pubN69600">
          <description>Up to two Guardians in each Storm Guardian unit in this Formation may exchange their close combat weapons and shuriken pistols for either flamers or fusion guns at no points cost, instead of the points cost listed on their datasheet.  In addition, up to two other Guardians in each of these units may exchange their close combat weapons for Power Swords for no points cost, instead of the points cost listed on their datasheet.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Close Support" id="0f09-9552-4f60-8b5d" hidden="false" publicationId="d744-5cc5-pubN69600">
          <description>Vypers, War Walkers, and the Vaul&apos;s Wrath Support Battery from this Formation gain the Preferred Enemy special rule when shooting at a unit that is within 12&quot; of a unit of Storm Guardians from this Formation.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
