          <description>A model fighting with a shardnet and impaler always gains the +1 bonus Attack for fighting with more than one Melee weapon.  A model fighting with a shardnet and impaler re-rolls all To Hit and To Wound rolls of 1 in close combat.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
